{"unit_id":"tag:09Z6:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为诺特概形（Noetherian scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0002>为可构造的集合（sets）的层（sheaf），它在<MATH_0003>上。存在层（sheaves）的单射映射（injective map）\n<MATH_0004>\n，其中<MATH_0005>为有限（finite）态射（morphism），<MATH_0006>为有限集合（finite set）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0007>为可构造的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），它在<MATH_0008>上。存在阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的单射映射（injective map）\n<MATH_0009>\n，其中<MATH_0010>为有限（finite）态射（morphism），<MATH_0011>为有限（finite）阿贝尔群（abelian group）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 设<MATH_0012>为诺特环（Noetherian ring）。设<MATH_0013>为可构造的<MATH_0014>-模（modules）的层（sheaf），它在<MATH_0015>上。存在模（modules）的层（sheaves）的单射映射（injective map）\n<MATH_0016>\n，其中<MATH_0017>为有限（finite）态射（morphism），<MATH_0018>为有限（finite）的<MATH_0019>-模（module）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n此外，可假设每个<MATH_0020>不可约（irreducible）、约化（reduced），映满（maps onto）一个不可约（irreducible）且约化（reduced）的闭子概形（closed subscheme）<MATH_0021>，使<MATH_0022>有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）于<MATH_0023>的一个非空开集（nonempty open）之上。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian scheme","target_term":"诺特概形"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"injective map","target_term":"单射映射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集合"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"injective map","target_term":"单射映射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"injective map","target