{"unit_id":"tag:09Z7:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0002>为可构造的集合（sets）的层（sheaf），它在<MATH_0003>上。存在层（sheaves）的单射映射（injective map）\n<MATH_0004>\n，其中<MATH_0005>为有限（finite）且有限表现（finitely presented）的态射（morphism），<MATH_0006>为有限集合（finite set）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0007>为可构造的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），它在<MATH_0008>上。存在阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的单射映射（injective map）\n<MATH_0009>\n，其中<MATH_0010>为有限（finite）且有限表现（finitely presented）的态射（morphism），<MATH_0011>为有限（finite）阿贝尔群（abelian group）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 设<MATH_0012>为诺特环（Noetherian ring）。设<MATH_0013>为可构造的<MATH_0014>-模（modules）的层（sheaf），它在<MATH_0015>上。存在模（modules）的层（sheaves）的单射映射（injective map）\n<MATH_0016>\n，其中<MATH_0017>为有限（finite）且有限表现（finitely presented）的态射（morphism），<MATH_0018>为有限（finite）的<MATH_0019>-模（module）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"injective map","target_term":"单射映射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集合"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"injective map","target_term":"单射映射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"injective map","target_term":"单射映射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"injective map","target_term":"单射映射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite set","target_term":"有限集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0F0N:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为诺特概形（Noetherian scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为对特殊化（specialization）封闭的子集（subset）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0003>为挠（torsion）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），它在<MATH_0004>上，且支撑（support）包含于<MATH_0005>。则<MATH_0006>为可构造的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）<MATH_0007>的滤过余极限（filtered colimit），使对每个<MATH_0008>，<MATH_0009>的支撑（support）包含于一个闭子集（closed subset），后者包含于<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0011>为诺特环（Noetherian ring），<MATH_0012>为层（sheaf），它是<MATH_0013>-模（modules）的层且在<MATH_0014>上，其支撑（support）包含于<MATH_0015>。则<MATH_0016>为可构造层（constructible sheaves）的滤过余极限（filtered colimit），这些层是<MATH_0017>-模（modules）的层，记为<MATH_0018>，使对每个<MATH_0019>，<MATH_0020>的支撑（support）包含于一个闭子集（closed subset），后者包含于<MATH_0021>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian scheme","target_term":"诺特概形"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特殊化"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支撑"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"filtered colimit","target_term":"滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支撑"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支撑"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"filtered colimit","target_term":"滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支撑"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Noetherian scheme","target_term":"诺特概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"specialization","target_term":"特殊化","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠","co